<h4>Film Lighthouse Privacy Notice</h4>

<p>Last Updated, October 4, 2026.</p>

<p>
    We know that you care how information about you is used and shared, and we appreciate your trust that we will do so carefully and sensibly. This Privacy Notice describes how Film Lighthouse.com, Inc. and/or its affiliates (collectively "Film Lighthouse") collect and process your personal information through Film Lighthouse’s websites, services, software, products and mobile applications that reference this Privacy Notice (together the "Film Lighthouse Services"). By using the Film Lighthouse Services, you are consenting to the practices described in this Privacy Notice.
</p>

<h4>
    What Personal Information About Users Does Film Lighthouse Collect?
</h4>
    
<p>We collect your personal information in order to provide and continually improve Film Lighthouse Services and your experience at Film Lighthouse.</p>

<h4>Here are the types of personal information we collect:</h4>
  
<p>
    Information You Give Us: We receive and store any information you provide in relation to Film Lighthouse Services. You can choose not to provide certain information, but then you might not be able to take advantage of many of our Film Lighthouse Services. See examples of what provided information we collect.
    Automatic Information: We automatically collect and store certain types of information about your use of Film Lighthouse Services, including information about your interaction with content and services available through Film Lighthouse Services. Like many websites, we use "cookies" and other unique identifiers, and we obtain certain types of information when your web browser or device accesses Film Lighthouse Services and other content served by or on behalf of Film Lighthouse on other websites. See examples of what information we automatically collect and store.
    Information from Other Sources: We might receive information about you from other sources, such as your name and email address when you sign in to Film Lighthouse Services using a third-party login service. See additional examples of the information we receive from other sources.
    For What Purposes Does Film Lighthouse Use Your Personal Information?
</p>
